WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Your agent can read the code.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.800
It can't read the meeting.

00:05.800 --> 00:09.500
This decision lives in a transcript, not a repo.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
LocalBot keeps that meeting on your Mac.

00:15.200 --> 00:18.300
And gives your agent a way in.

00:18.400 --> 00:22.100
Redis, for pub-sub. Cluster mode, deferred.

00:22.200 --> 00:26.800
Ask why Redis, and whether the cache
should start in cluster mode.

00:30.000 --> 00:32.600
It answers with the line it came from.

00:34.500 --> 00:37.900
Then it lists the decisions, ready to use.

00:43.100 --> 00:46.200
Eighteen meetings. One local library.

00:46.900 --> 00:49.300
Read-only. No account.

00:50.900 --> 00:55.400
LocalBot. Install with Homebrew.
Connect with one command.
